      383.84,
      286.68,
      478.64
    ],
    "text": "Land Min\u2019s Ref No.: 4-3/9/2013/WS/689. I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amended) Act. No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intend to acquire the following land/Servitude which is required for a public purpose. .",
