      50.88,
      480.07,
      286.69,
      612.08
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land/Servitude to be Acquired: The allotments of Land in extent about 0.0133 He, depicted in Sheet No. 11 Plan Zonal 05 from Zonal 05 in C. M. No. 620086 prepared by Surveyor-General, situated at Pllewela Village, and The allotments of Land in extent about 0.0034 He, depicted in Sheet No. 04 Plan Zonal 01 from Zonal 03 in C. M. No. 620087 prepare by Surveyor-General, situated at Ellewatta village, 256C, Thumbagoda Grama Niladhari Division, Helauda Minor Division, Balangoda Divisional Secretariat Rathnapura District and Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
