    "text": "Zonal 01 from Zonal 03 in C. M. No. 620087 3. Lot No. 65 Name of the land: Benkiyawatta; Claimant: Government, P. M. Nandawathi, Benkiyawatta, Thumba-goda, Balangoda; Extent: 0.0034 Hectare.",
