    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.28,
      468.77,
      540.57,
      702.8
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby require appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Balangoda Divisional Secretariat on the 17th February, 2016 at 10.00 a.m. And are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 10th day of February, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation of such amount. CHAMPIKA NIROSH DHARMAPALA, Divisional Secretary, Balangoda. Balangoda Divisional Secretariat, 18th January, 2016. 02 - 100",
